# Explicit synthetic input diagnostic; never install in a normal phone image.
# Do not run rwtouch read: it would compete with backboardd for the same queue.
# Wake once before the single swipe: backboardd rejected the first run as dim/off.
# No physical driver; reuse the existing HOME button and gesture producers.
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 90 button home 80 wait 5 swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 500
